📊 Benefits of Generics

| Benefit     | Description                   |
| ----------- | ----------------------------- |
| Type Safety | Errors caught at compile time |
| Reusability | Works with multiple types     |
| Readability | Cleaner code                  |
| No Casting  | Automatic type handling       |

---

